  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wellbeing support to Association Najdeh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decades of marginalization and persecution have taken a toll, along with a sense of abandonment from political leaders and the international community; the escalations in 2024 and 2026 have been a tipping point - with many Najdeh staff themselves living in Palestinian camps/and or displaced during the war. There is an immediate need to support their wellbeing.
Activities will focus on staff care and psychological wellbeing for all staff. This includes a staff care day for all Najdeh staff, debriefing sessions, psychological support sessions, mind and body therapy and team wellbeing support. Over 300 staff will benefit from these activities.</narrative>
  </description>
